    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Traces and deferred instrumentation",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 64,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Use **Explore \u2192 Tempo** to find HTTP, workflow and persistence spans. Production sampling defaults to 10%.\n\n**Future work:** external email/SMS (#127), payments (#128), subscription billing (#136). These signals and alert rules are not implemented. No data in other panels can indicate no traffic or a missing scrape; check reachability first."
